    },
    "Because of the fins, eliminations are restricted to cells that can see all fin positions." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of why eliminations are restricted to cells that can see all fin positions in the Fish Pattern Technique.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aufgrund der Flossen sind Eliminierungen auf Zellen beschränkt, die alle Flossenpositionen sehen können."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Because of the fins, eliminations are restricted to cells that can see all fin positions."
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Because of the fins, eliminations are restricted to cells that can see every fin position."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Debido a las aletas, las eliminaciones están restringidas a las celdas que puedan ver todas las posiciones de las aletas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En raison des nageoires, les éliminations sont limitées aux cellules qui peuvent voir toutes les positions des nageoires."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フィンの影響で、削除はすべてのフィンの位置が見えるセルに限定されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "핀들로 인해 제거는 모든 핀 위치를 볼 수 있는 셀로 제한됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于鳍的存在，仅限于能看到所有鳍位置的单元格进行消除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Because this house must contain a %lld, we know that it has to be on of these cells." : {
