    "However, this pattern has extra candidates (fins) that prevent it from being a perfect fish:" : {
      "comment" : "Explanation of why a fish pattern with fins is not considered a \"perfect\" fish.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedoch hat dieses Muster zusätzliche Kandidaten (Flossen), die verhindern, dass es ein perfektes Fischmuster ist:"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "However, this pattern has extra candidates (fins) that prevent it from being a perfect fish:"
          }
        },
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "However, this pattern has extra candidates (fins) that stop it from being a perfect fish:"
          }
