    "We can rule out every other number by looking at the row, column, or box that affect this cell. Leaving %lld the only remaining option" : {
      "comment" : "Explanation step showing the constraints applied to a cell in the Naked Single technique. Highlights the cell itself and each cell in the row, column, or box that constrain it.",
